---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — ToolXDev"
  description="Terms of service and acceptable use guidelines for the ToolXDev platform."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Effective Date: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using ToolXDev (toolxdev.org), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the services.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Use of Online Utilities</h2>
        <p>
          Our tools are provided free of charge for lawful, legitimate development and creative purposes. You agree not to attempt to disrupt the service, reverse engineer backend endpoints, or perform automated denial-of-service attempts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The tools and tutorials on ToolXDev are provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. While we strive for accuracy in data processing, you remain responsible for verifying critical data and calculations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
